{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FeMgO1hGFR1794401163.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港國際棍網球六人賽下月舉行。</p><p></p><p>今屆有來自五個國家及地區，包括港隊、中國隊及日本勁旅，共十支男女子隊參加，七支外隊之中，越南及莫斯科的球隊首次來港角逐。</p><p></p><p>六人賽是2028年洛杉磯奧運比賽項目，棍網球總會希望本地球員主場與海外球隊交鋒，有助提升實力。賽事12月11至13日黃竹坑遊樂場舉行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T17:01:45.335127+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T12:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:37:18.593203+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T16:55:00.301098+00:00","content_hash":"350bc1dace4bbbddbf166a0d37181799ef37a2f76b11de8cdbf1b04bb208dff9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T17:01:45.335127+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}